codegen`. Existing WASM
+SIMD analysis imports JIT types, and Wasmtime is configured with its Cranelift
+backend. Decoupling WASM compiler analysis is a separate cleanup and is not
+required for the mobile runtime.
+
+## Required release gate
+
+Before publishing an Apple runtime artifact, CI must prove both:
+
+```sh
+cargo check --lib --no-default-features --features mobile-runtime
+cargo tree --no-default-features --features mobile-runtime
+```
+
+and reject dependency trees containing:
+
+- `cranelift*`
+- `wasmtime`
+- `libloading`
+
+Runtime selection alone is not sufficient; the dependencies must be absent from
+the compiled graph.
